  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0dcfa8577ab5249259fa110adbb5792e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vol10_HOLD_LALI
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CombatActionDefinition
  actionId: Vol10_HOLD_LALI
  displayName: Hold to lariat
  gameplayTrigger: Exact action registry ID; R/T starts a local left/right hold-to-lariat.
    Defender Q/E or RequestThrowEscape(side, playbackId) escapes between 0.15 and
    0.55 pair seconds. Server-resolved exchanges select their outcome by ID and never
    accept a local override.
  entryAndInterruption: Living available grounded actors in range; existing approach;
    shared clock and equipment leases. Reset, disable, unexpected death and cancellation
    release both participants.
  recovery: Release/escape separate into idle; the lariat's surviving victim uses
    existing GetUp. No new armor, invulnerability or instant-kill rule.
  presentation: Restrained grip/break movement dust and routed cloth/whoosh audio;
    no damage, hurt flash or hit-stop on a grip/break. Lariat uses heavy contact
    and damaging landing feedback. Shared lighting, camera and presentation cleanup
    remain active.
  contacts:
  - strikeId: Vol10_HOLD_LALI/grapple_grip
    attack: {fileID: 7400000, guid: 3c510cca4e748262e8816db80f3a4753, type: 2}
    reaction: {fileID: 7400000, guid: 4238fdf2da237fa8dbe30342fd09c739, type: 2}
    seconds: 0.1
    activeWindowSeconds: {x: 0.083333336, y: 0.11666667}
    strikingLimb: 15
    targetRegion: Paired grip and grounded foot support
    directionInVictimSpace: {x: 0, y: 0, z: -1}
    reactionPolicy: 0
    result: 4
    presentationGroup: grapple_grip
    nonDamagingInteraction: 1
    continuation: Both roles retain one clock and playback identity. The selected
      source pair continues through release, escape or lariat landing without restarting
      the victim reaction.
  - strikeId: Vol10_HOLD_LALI/heavy_hit
    attack: {fileID: 7400000, guid: 90d69c8b3f7bcecfc914e57f13a85993, type: 2}
    reaction: {fileID: 7400000, guid: adba18553225792c3aadd8952925e226, type: 2}
    seconds: 1.5
    activeWindowSeconds: {x: 1.4833333, y: 1.5166667}
